knowledge/ .md  = 81
amendments/ .md = 4 ['golden-comparison-verdict.md', 'r3-snapshot-fixture-update-paths.md', 'r6-snapshot-practice-corpus.md', 'r8-golden-update-flag.md']
disjoint? True
union           = 85

=> 84 = |knowledge| + |amendments| - 1  =  81 + 4 - 1 = 84
   i.e. the count a reader gets by taking every staged .md file in the package
   (81 under knowledge/ + 4 under amendments/) minus the one the bullet above names.

the number the round-54 text should have used, and the one the round-55 counter
pins, is |knowledge/**/*.md| = 81 (the counter's staged_count() globs only
merge/tameshi/knowledge/**/*.md and requires the literal token 'staged=81' in
the corrections block).
